\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Chapter 3\
# Playwright Project Standards\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.1\
\
## Rule\
\
Always use TypeScript.\
\
---\
\
## Priority\
\
\uc0\u11088 \u11088 \u11088 \u11088 \u11088  Mandatory\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
TypeScript memberikan:\
\
- Static Type Checking\
- Better IntelliSense\
- Compile Time Error Detection\
- Safer Refactoring\
- Better AI Code Generation\
\
Framework enterprise tidak boleh menggunakan JavaScript biasa.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```ts\
interface User \{\
    username: string;\
    password: string;\
\}\
\
const admin: User = \{\
    username: 'admin',\
    password: 'password'\
\};\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```js\
const admin = \{\
    username: "admin",\
    password: "password"\
\}\
```\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Always generate TypeScript.\
\
Never generate JavaScript.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.2\
\
## Rule\
\
Enable Strict Mode.\
\
---\
\
## Priority\
\
\uc0\u11088 \u11088 \u11088 \u11088 \u11088  Mandatory\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Strict mode mengurangi bug sejak proses compile.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```json\
\{\
    "compilerOptions": \{\
        "strict": true\
    \}\
\}\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```json\
\{\
    "strict": false\
\}\
```\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Every generated project must enable strict mode.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.3\
\
## Rule\
\
One Feature Per Test File.\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
File kecil:\
\
\uc0\u10004  mudah dicari\
\
\uc0\u10004  mudah direview\
\
\uc0\u10004  merge conflict kecil\
\
\uc0\u10004  execution lebih cepat dipahami\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```\
tests/\
\
login.spec.ts\
\
logout.spec.ts\
\
create-user.spec.ts\
\
delete-user.spec.ts\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```\
tests/\
\
all-feature.spec.ts\
```\
\
isi:\
\
- login\
\
- logout\
\
- profile\
\
- dashboard\
\
- inventory\
\
- transaction\
\
- reporting\
\
- dll\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Split test by business capability.\
\
Never create giant spec files.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.4\
\
## Rule\
\
One Business Scenario Per Test.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```ts\
test('Admin can login', async () => \{\})\
```\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```ts\
test('Admin creates new product', async () => \{\})\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```ts\
test('Login, Create Product, Delete Product, Logout', async () => \{\})\
```\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Satu test = satu tujuan.\
\
Jika gagal, engineer langsung tahu bagian mana yang rusak.\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Never combine multiple business scenarios.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.5\
\
## Rule\
\
Tests must be independent.\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Playwright menjalankan test secara paralel.\
\
Test tidak boleh bergantung pada test lain.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```\
Test A\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Login\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Execute\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Finish\
```\
\
```\
Test B\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Login\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Execute\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Finish\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```\
Test A\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Create Product\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Test B\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Edit Product\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Test C\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Delete Product\
```\
\
Jika Test A gagal\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Semua gagal.\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Every test must be executable individually.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.6\
\
## Rule\
\
Never depend on execution order.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```\
Run:\
\
5\
\
1\
\
9\
\
2\
\
7\
\
3\
\
```\
\
Semua tetap PASS.\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```\
Run:\
\
Login\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Create\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Update\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
Delete\
```\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
CI tidak menjamin urutan execution.\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Assume tests run in random order.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.7\
\
## Rule\
\
Never hardcode environment.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```ts\
await page.goto(process.env.BASE_URL!)\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```ts\
await page.goto(\
    "https://staging.company.com"\
)\
```\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Project biasanya memiliki:\
\
- local\
\
- dev\
\
- sit\
\
- uat\
\
- staging\
\
- production\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Always load URL from configuration.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.8\
\
## Rule\
\
Never hardcode credentials.\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```\
.env\
```\
\
```\
USERNAME=\
\
PASSWORD=\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```ts\
fill("admin")\
\
fill("123456")\
```\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Always use environment variables.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.9\
\
## Rule\
\
Use Playwright Config as single source of truth.\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Semua konfigurasi berada di satu tempat.\
\
Misalnya:\
\
- timeout\
\
- retries\
\
- browser\
\
- reporter\
\
- workers\
\
- trace\
\
---\
\
## Good\
\
```\
playwright.config.ts\
```\
\
---\
\
## Bad\
\
```\
Timeout\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
config\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
helper\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
spec\
\
\uc0\u8595 \
\
page\
```\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Configuration belongs only in playwright.config.ts unless there is a clear need for environment-specific overrides.\
\
---\
\
# Rule 3.10\
\
## Rule\
\
Keep Playwright updated.\
\
---\
\
## Why\
\
Microsoft rutin memperbaiki:\
\
- locator engine\
\
- browser engine\
\
- tracing\
\
- performance\
\
- assertion\
\
---\
\
## AI Rule\
\
Prefer stable latest Playwright release.\
\
Avoid obsolete APIs.\
\
